full day writing down a lot of nice heartfelt things emotional things very flattering things

01:27:50.870 --> 01:27:59.580
about our next speaker and then i don't know

01:28:00.920 --> 01:28:03.120
crumpled it up, thrown it out, because I don't want to give a big head.

01:28:04.270 --> 01:28:10.480
In all seriousness, 12 years ago, I decided I wanted to be a professional wrestling fan.

01:28:13.840 --> 01:28:21.970
And, well, if that's true, if that's true, a lot of it is due, and it pains me to say this,

01:28:22.960 --> 01:28:27.830
the man sitting to my right, because I live two blocks from Titan Tower, and I sent tapes there,

01:28:28.010 --> 01:28:29.900
because I had done some TV before ECW.

01:28:30.000 --> 01:28:32.300
I sent tapes, I called and sent letters.

01:28:33.010 --> 01:28:34.650
And then we got a return phone call.

01:28:35.750 --> 01:28:40.020
And did the same thing down in Atlanta.

01:28:40.260 --> 01:28:41.580
Then we got a return phone call.

01:28:44.570 --> 01:28:48.110
I got one return phone call, and I got a tryout.

01:28:48.920 --> 01:28:51.270
And I'm still here, and I love it.

01:28:51.960 --> 01:28:56.970
And tomorrow night, I'm going to be the first man to be a solo announcer on a live pay-per-view.

01:29:00.320 --> 01:29:13.490
And that's because the man standing to my right gave me a shot when nobody else would and who basically has made the ECW that you see now possible.

01:29:14.540 --> 01:29:15.500
You are you who did it, Paul.

01:29:17.340 --> 01:29:21.760
What else can I say? Paul Heyman.

01:29:58.760 --> 01:29:59.480
This is such an...

01:30:00.960 --> 01:30:03.980
This is a bit overwhelming, to be honest with you.

01:30:07.700 --> 01:30:09.060
This is really overwhelming.

01:30:10.870 --> 01:30:13.650
If you don't mind me being selfish and just indulging me for a second.

01:30:14.340 --> 01:30:18.180
Todd Gordon, thank you so fucking much for giving me a job in September 93.

01:30:19.020 --> 01:30:20.400
Thank you so much.

01:30:28.300 --> 01:30:29.540
That can express my gratitude.

01:30:30.760 --> 01:30:32.540
for the opportunity that you afforded me

01:30:33.570 --> 01:30:37.300
to work with these people and to work with you

01:30:37.300 --> 01:30:40.210
and just to give me the shot

01:30:40.210 --> 01:30:42.020
at what we have accomplished here.

01:30:42.240 --> 01:30:44.760
I cannot begin to thank you.

01:30:45.420 --> 01:30:47.960
Thank you so very much, very much.

01:30:58.650 --> 01:30:59.970
Listening to people all night long.

01:31:00.000 --> 01:31:01.840
and I'm just going to get up there and say a couple things,

01:31:01.900 --> 01:31:02.860
